      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know man. everything just feels like a math problem that i keep getting wrong. i work 50 hours a week just to stay underwater. rent, bills, debt... it's like i'm paying for the right to keep being tired. it never actually gets better, it just gets more expensive to exist.",
