    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks but a professional isnt gonna change the rent prices or my student loans. the math just doesnt work. even if i save every penny, i'm still just running on a treadmill that's getting faster every year. it feels less like a life and more like a debt i didn't ask for. i just feel like there's no exit, you know? just this endless loop of work, sleep, and bills until i eventually just collapse.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
